# Compile-time oracle fixtures (packages/ui, type-contracts.oracle.test.ts).
# Written INSIDE the package and removed in afterAll — which does not run when the task is
# KILLED, and turbo kills sibling tasks the moment another package's suite fails. The residue
# then makes `pnpm verify` red on generated fixtures, pointing at the wrong defect entirely.
# Same class as the `out/` entry above (9ca0189: "verify was linting generated bundles").
.oracle-typecheck/
